ref":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7532"}]}],"start":0,"end":166}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] once encountered a Salamandrake [[Titan]]. {{Source|TCG:SAS-091|SAS-091}}","text":"Dante Vale once encountered a Salamandrake Titan. [TCG:SAS-091]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Salamandrake is able light itself up like a beacon and can start large fires. Its 'Fire Burst' ability can disorientate weak [[Titans]] as soon as Salamandrake is invoked.\n\n{{clear}}","text":"Salamandrake is able light itself up like a beacon and can start large fires. Its 'Fire Burst' ability can disorientate weak Titans as soon as Salamandrake is invoked."},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\">\nSalamandrake_Icon.jpg|Salamandrake's Icon\nSalamandrake.png|Salamandrake\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Meso-Titans]]\n[[Category:TCG Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{MesoBox}}","text":"Salamandrake_Icon.jpg|Salamandrake's Icon\nSalamandrake.png|Salamandrake"}],"full_text":"Salamandrake is a Meso-Titan who appears as a fiery green serpent with red markings on its head and large fangs. It is similar in appearance to and has the same base stats as Dambala.\n\n== History ==\nDante Vale once encountered a Salamandrake Titan. [TCG:SAS-091]\n\n== Abilities ==\nSalamandrake is able light itself up like a beacon and can start large fires. Its 'Fire Burst' ability can disorientate weak Titans as soon as Salamandrake is invoked.\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nSalamandrake_Icon.jpg|Salamandrake's Icon\nSalamandrake.png|Salamandrake","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox titan\n| image   = File:Salamandrake.png\n| attack  = 2\n| defense = 2\n| type    = [[Meso-Titan]]\n| ability = Fire Burst\n| first   = [[TCG:SAS-091|SAS-091]]\n}}\n'''Salamandrake''' is a [[Meso-Titan]] who appears as a fiery green serpent with red markings on its head and large fangs. It is similar in appearance to and has the same base stats as [[Dambala]].\n\n== History ==\n[[Dante Vale]] once encountered a Salamandrake [[Titan]]. {{Source|TCG:SAS-091|SAS-091}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nSalamandrake is able light itself up like a beacon and can start large fires. Its 'Fire Burst' ability can disorientate weak [[Titans]] as soon as Salamandrake is invoked.\n\n{{clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\">\nSalamandrake_Icon.jpg|Salamandrake's Icon\nSalamandrake.png|Salamandrake\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Meso-Titans]]\n[[Category:TCG Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{MesoBox}}","categories":["Meso-Titans","TCG Titans","Titans"],"links":[{"target_title":"Meso-Titan","label":"Meso-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2834","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Meso-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Meso-Titans"},{"target_title":"TCG:SAS-091","label":"SAS-091","target_id":"huntik:page:7532","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-091","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7532"},{"target_title":"Meso-Titan","label":"Meso-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2834","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Meso-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Meso-Titans"},{"target_title":"Dambala","label":"Dambala","target_id":"huntik:page:15031","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dambala","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A15031"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Titan","label":"Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2010","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2010"},{"target_title":"Titans","label":"Titans","target_id":"huntik:page:2010","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titans","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2010"},{"target_title":"Category:Titans","label":"